** Autowiring In Spring

- Autowiring in spring is feature in spring to inject the object dependencies automatically.
- It is not working for primitive types and strings it will work only with Object Types.
- Autowiring we can done using two ways
  1] xmlConfig :- autowiring Modes
     - ByName
     - Type
     - Constructor

  2] Annotation
     - @Autowired
     - @Qualifier



